---
description: REST API route conventions
globs: src/app/api/**/*.ts,docs/agents/API_CONTRACT.md,docs/API.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/agents/API_CONTRACT.md` when changing routes.

- Validate with Zod
- Include `requestId`
- Consistent `{ error: { code, message, details } }`
- Never expose secrets or stack traces
- Document behavior changes in `docs/API.md`
